        `the part: the licence kind it leads to` IS `grade 1 licence`
        `the item number` IS 3
        `column A: any one of` IS LIST (`column A: a certificate` `a Training Division certificate with no grade stated`)
        `column B: any one of` IS LIST (`training of up to` 50 `a Training Division certificate with no grade stated`)
        `column C: valid for three years from the commencement day` IS FALSE

